# 1.8.0 saves: two slots in turn. Save at HARBOR (5,3), walk two steps right, save again, power-cycle: CONTINUE
# puts you at the second save. Then flip a byte in the slot that save went to (slot 0) and power-cycle: the
# torn slot is skipped and CONTINUE falls back to the first save.
qa 03000000
wait 30
press START+L+R 4
wait 200
expect x 5
expect y 3
press START 3
wait 20
press DOWN 3
wait 8
press DOWN 3
wait 8
press DOWN 3
wait 8
press DOWN 3
wait 8
press DOWN 3
wait 8
press A 3
wait 60
mash A talking
wait 30
press B 3
wait 30
press RIGHT 16
wait 20
press RIGHT 16
wait 30
expect x 7
press START 3
wait 20
press DOWN 3
wait 8
press DOWN 3
wait 8
press DOWN 3
wait 8
press DOWN 3
wait 8
press DOWN 3
wait 8
press A 3
wait 60
mash A talking
wait 30
press B 3
wait 30
reset
wait 120
press START 3
wait 60
press A 3
wait 120
shot cont2
expect x 7
corrupt 10
reset
wait 120
press START 3
wait 60
press A 3
wait 120
shot cont1
expect x 5
